# Product Context

## Users

Vietnamese farmers, coffee growers, farm owners, agricultural cooperatives. **Not technical.** Optimize for simplicity and mobile-first use outdoors.

## Core Features

- Garden Management (multi-garden)
- Farm Journal (activity logs with expense tracking)
- Weather Monitoring
- Watering / Fertilizer / Spray schedule reminders
- AI Agricultural Assistant (chat)
- Disease Diagnosis (photo upload)
- AI Monthly Reports
- Harvest tracking (via activity type)

## Design Principles

- Simple UI, large buttons, readable typography
- Mobile-first, large spacing, minimal clicks
- Friendly Vietnamese language
- Green color palette, card-based layout
- Avoid dashboard clutter and unnecessary charts

## What NOT to Build

- Landing pages or marketing content
- E-commerce or marketplace features
- Complex ERP dashboards
- Auto-triggered AI features

See `docs/product.md` for full product description and `docs/roadmap.md` for feature status.
